166 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Dear Hiring Team\054\nI designed the AI agent at Remuner that shipped to every customer\072 a chat panel plus embedded answers where sales reps and managers consult their commission data and plans\056 I owned the conversation design and the trust patterns\054 deciding what the agent answers\054 what it declines\054 and how it signals uncertainty\056 After release I iterated on tone and answer formats\054 and adapted terminology per customer\056\nThe AI Lab setup\054 one designer working with twelve engineers\054 is the mode I know\056 At Remuner I was the sole designer across the whole product\056 Before that\054 at Abacum\054 I designed the dataset configuration layer of an FP\046A platform\056 I prototype with Claude\055based tooling daily\054 and I built the design system side too\072 a token pipeline from Figma to a published npm package\056\nHappy to go deeper on the agent work\072 https\072\057\057manel\055leiva\056com\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 165 0 R
     /Pg 160 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
